                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="examples-section" id="hour-table" aria-labelledby="hour-table-title">
        <h2 id="hour-table-title">24-hour KST to Eastern Time table</h2>
        <p>This table gives a complete daily scan. Use the EST column when Eastern Time is UTC-5 and the EDT column when Eastern Time is UTC-4. The converter above is still the safer choice for exact calendar dates because it labels the active abbreviation automatically.</p>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th>KST</th><th>Eastern during EST season</th><th>Eastern during EDT season</th></tr>
            </thead>
