      <section class="examples-section" id="field-guides" aria-labelledby="field-guides-title">
        <h2 id="field-guides-title">Field guides for teams that work with South Korea</h2>
        <p>Different industries hit different failure points. A software team cares about release freezes. A manufacturer cares about the local Korean business day. A student cares about exam access. A traveler cares about arrival date and local airport time. KST to EST planning works best when the conversion is attached to the job being done.</p>
        <div class="kst-playbook-grid">
          {playbooks.map((item) => (
            <article>
