        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="examples-section" aria-labelledby="travel-title">
        <h2 id="travel-title">Flight planning, tourism, and the date boundary</h2>
        <p>Airlines publish departure and arrival times in local airport time, so an itinerary from Incheon to JFK or Newark already mixes KST and Eastern Time by leg. The converter helps with surrounding coordination: ride pickups, hotel arrivals, family updates, recovery time, and tourism bookings. Convert the exact local event and keep the weekday visible.</p>
